{
 "duration": 24.281,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Rachel wore her warm gloves on the whole steep climb.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.541
  },
  {
   "text": "Her hands sweated, and at the windy summit the gloves were damp and her fingers went numb.",
   "start": 3.841,
   "end": 8.775
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 9.075,
   "end": 10.002
  },
  {
   "text": "Climb in thin liner gloves, or none if you're warm.",
   "start": 10.402,
   "end": 13.233
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep a dry, warm pair in a plastic bag in your pack,",
   "start": 13.633,
   "end": 16.671
  },
  {
   "text": "and put them on at the top before you cool down.",
   "start": 16.871,
   "end": 19.118
  },
  {
   "text": "Her hands stayed warm all the way down.",
   "start": 19.518,
   "end": 21.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 22.05,
   "end": 24.081
  }
 ],
